.TH SETURA 1 "" "Zyvor Setura" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
setura \- publish and diagnose a local Envoy gateway
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B setura
[\fB\-\-context\fR \fINAME\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B setura
forwards Kubernetes Gateway API listeners to IPv4 loopback and verifies
routes from the client side.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B publish GATEWAY \-\-listener NAME
forward an Envoy listener to IPv4 loopback
.TP
.B explain URL
probe a URL from this host
.TP
.B check FILE [\-\-junit FILE]
run a JSON file of route assertions
.TP
.B inspect ROUTE
show route conditions and backend inventory
.TP
.B listeners GATEWAY
show listener attachment and conditions
.TP
.B gate ROUTE URL
require current parent status and a probe streak
.TP
.B compare URL \-\-target dns|IP
probe the same URL via DNS and/or IPs
.TP
.B snapshot / diff BEFORE AFTER
capture and compare Gateway and HTTPRoute specs
.TP
.B map / impact TARGET
render or query the declared route topology
.TP
.B lint
statically analyze Gateway and HTTPRoute specs (offline)
.TP
.B completion bash|zsh|fish
print a shell completion script
.TP
.B man
print the manual page (roff)
.TP
.B ai REPORT [\-\-model NAME]
explain saved evidence, optionally with local Ollama
.TP
.B doctor / capabilities / exposure
check permissions, controllers and Service exposure
.TP
.B version
print the version
.PP
Run \fBsetura COMMAND \-h\fR for the flags of a command.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
success
.TP
.B 1
the check, gate or lint failed
.TP
.B 2
usage or input error
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/zyvorai/zyvor\-setura\-gateway
